{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: the original likelihood scored `col(y, t)` inside a loop, so the protected observation was not a plain top-level identifier and was scored multiple times. The SafeStan version reshapes the original `matrix[N, T] y` into a protected `vector[N * T] y` in Stan column-major order, with `y[n + (t - 1) * N] = original_y[n, t]`, constructs the matching mean vector after all parameter priors, and observes `y` once with a built-in `normal` sampling statement. This is a deterministic reshape and preserves the same product normal likelihood.
","model_safe_stan":"// http://www.mrc-bsu.cam.ac.uk/bugs/winbugs/Vol1.pdf
// Page 3: Rats
data {
  int<lower=0> N;
  int<lower=0> T;
  vector[T] x;
  vector[N * T] y;
  real xbar;
}
parameters {
  vector[N] alpha_z;
  vector[N] beta_z;

  real mu_alpha;
  real mu_beta;

  real<lower=0> sigmasq_y;
  real<lower=0> sigmasq_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigmasq_beta;
}
transformed parameters {
  real<lower=0> sigma_y; // sigma in original bugs model
  real<lower=0> sigma_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma_beta;
  vector[N] alpha;
  vector[N] beta;

  sigma_y = sqrt(sigmasq_y);
  sigma_alpha = sqrt(sigmasq_alpha);
  sigma_beta = sqrt(sigmasq_beta);

  alpha = (mu_alpha * 100.0) + alpha_z * sigma_alpha;
  beta = (mu_beta * 100.0) + beta_z * sigma_beta;
}
model {
  vector[N * T] y_hat;

  mu_alpha ~ normal(0, 1);
  mu_beta ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigmasq_y ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  sigmasq_alpha ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  sigmasq_beta ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  alpha_z ~ normal(0, 1);
  beta_z ~ normal(0, 1);

  if (N > 0 && T > 0) {
    for (t in 1 : T) {
      for (n in 1 : N) {
        y_hat[n + (t - 1) * N] = alpha[n] + beta[n] * (x[t] - xbar);
      }
    }
  }
  y ~ normal(y_hat, sigma_y);
}
generated quantities {
  real alpha0;
  alpha0 = mu_alpha - xbar * mu_beta;
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":4,"T":1,"x":[2.4630140658804436],"y":[4.0,4.0,4.0,2.0],"xbar":2.953594575977783}","protected_variables":["y"]}
